{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/web-worker/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Forest_LIM","author":"LIM","siteUrl":"https://logic-phantom.github.io"}},"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h1>웹 워커(Web Worker) 완벽 가이드</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>브라우저의 메인 스레드가 숨통이 트이는 순간</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>🔍 웹 워커란?</h2>\n<p>웹 워커(Web Worker)는 <strong>웹 애플리케이션에서 스레드를 백그라운드로 분리하여 실행</strong>할 수 있게 해주는 브라우저 API입니다. 자바스크립트는 기본적으로 싱글 스레드이기 때문에 무거운 연산이 메인 스레드를 막아 UI가 멈추거나 렌더링이 지연되는 문제가 발생할 수 있습니다. 이런 상황에서 웹 워커를 활용하면 <strong>메인 스레드와 별개로 비동기 처리를 수행</strong>할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<h2>🧠 웹 워커의 구조</h2>\n<p>웹 워커는 기본적으로 다음과 같은 구조로 동작합니다:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>메인 스레드에서 워커 생성</strong></li>\n<li><strong>워커 파일은 별도의 JS 파일</strong>로 존재해야 함</li>\n<li><strong><code class=\"language-text\">postMessage</code>를 통해 데이터 전송 및 수신</strong></li>\n<li><strong>워커는 <code class=\"language-text\">onmessage</code> 핸들러로 메시지 수신</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// main.js</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> worker <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Worker</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"worker.js\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\nworker<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">postMessage</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">value</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\nworker<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function-variable function\">onmessage</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">e</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"워커 결과:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// worker.js</span>\n<span class=\"token function-variable function\">onmessage</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">e</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">postMessage</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>⚙️ 종류</h2>\n<h3>1. Dedicated Worker</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>단일 스레드와 1:1 연결 (한 페이지 전용)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2. Shared Worker</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>여러 브라우저 탭에서 공유 가능</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>3. Service Worker</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>네트워크 요청 캐싱, 오프라인 지원 등에 활용 (PWA 등)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🛠️ 활용 사례</h2>\n<h3>🎨 1. 이미지/비디오 프로세싱</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>필터, 썸네일 생성 등 무거운 연산을 백그라운드에서 처리</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🔍 2. 대용량 데이터 처리</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>예: CSV 파싱, 대규모 JSON 가공</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🧬 3. 머신러닝 / WebAssembly 연동</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>TensorFlow.js나 WASM과 함께 사용하면 성능을 극대화할 수 있음</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📊 4. 실시간 데이터 분석</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>주식, IoT 센서 등 실시간으로 들어오는 데이터를 웹 워커가 분석</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>✅ 장점</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>🧵 UI 스레드와 분리되어 렌더링 끊김 최소화</li>\n<li>⚡ CPU 집중 작업을 백그라운드에서 처리 가능</li>\n<li>🔄 데이터 전송은 직렬화되어 안정적</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⚠️ 단점 및 주의사항</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>📁 워커는 별도 파일로 존재해야 하며 <strong>DOM 접근 불가</strong></li>\n<li>🚫 LocalStorage, Window, Document 등의 객체 사용 불가</li>\n<li>🧪 디버깅이 어렵고, 네트워크 로깅 등에서도 제외될 수 있음</li>\n<li>📦 번들러 설정이 까다로울 수 있음 (Webpack, Vite 등)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🧪 팁: 웹 워커 성능 최적화</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>워커가 너무 많이 생성되면 오히려 브라우저 성능 저하</li>\n<li>데이터 전송량은 최소화 (postMessage는 복사됨)</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">transferable objects</code>를 활용해 복사 대신 메모리 이동 가능</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> buffer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ArrayBuffer</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">1024</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\nworker<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">postMessage</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>buffer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>buffer<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 복사 대신 참조 이전</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>🚀 결론</h2>\n<p>웹 워커는 브라우저 환경에서도 멀티스레드처럼 병렬 처리를 가능하게 해주는 강력한 기능입니다. UI와 별도로 처리해야 할 무거운 연산이 있다면 적극적으로 활용해보세요. 사용자 경험을 개선하는 동시에 성능도 확보할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📚 참고 자료</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MDN Web Docs - Web Workers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/web/updates/2018/10/audio-worklet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Developers - Using Web Workers</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>","excerpt":"웹 워커(Web Worker) 완벽 가이드 브라우저의 메인 스레드가 숨통이 트이는 순간 🔍 웹 워커란? 웹 워커(Web Worker)는 웹 애플리케이션에서 스레드를 백그라운드로 분리하여 실행할 수 있게 해주는 브라우저 API입니다. 자바스크립트는 기본적으로 싱글 스레드이기 때문에 무거운 연산이 메인 스레드를 막아 UI…","fields":{"slug":"/web-worker/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Web Workers: 브라우저에서 멀티스레딩 구현하기","summary":"Web Workers를 활용한 브라우저 멀티스레딩 구현 방법","date":"2025.06.05.","isoDate":"2025-06-05","updatedAt":null,"categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/1b4b963f8f7fd40c4678ca452d612345/34104/web-worker.png","srcSet":"/static/1b4b963f8f7fd40c4678ca452d612345/5ce94/web-worker.png 256w,\n/static/1b4b963f8f7fd40c4678ca452d612345/8a20a/web-worker.png 512w,\n/static/1b4b963f8f7fd40c4678ca452d612345/34104/web-worker.png 1024w","sizes":"(min-width: 1024px) 1024px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/1b4b963f8f7fd40c4678ca452d612345/99d55/web-worker.webp 256w,\n/static/1b4b963f8f7fd40c4678ca452d612345/3591c/web-worker.webp 512w,\n/static/1b4b963f8f7fd40c4678ca452d612345/e306d/web-worker.webp 1024w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1024px) 1024px, 100vw"}]},"width":1024,"height":1024}},"publicURL":"/static/1b4b963f8f7fd40c4678ca452d612345/web-worker.png"}}}}]},"related":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"054b4a40-9d4c-5d66-b554-b9ffa465b85c","fields":{"slug":"/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"💾 웹 브라우저 안의 완전한 RDBMS: SQLite WASM과 OPFS 완벽 가이드","summary":"서버 없이 브라우저에서 SQL을 쿼리하다","date":"2026.09.27.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/ec0ce4de2d05ed3ee2141d0cd508a6ed/473b7/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm.png","srcSet":"/static/ec0ce4de2d05ed3ee2141d0cd508a6ed/be4d9/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm.png 192w,\n/static/ec0ce4de2d05ed3ee2141d0cd508a6ed/5fc50/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm.png 384w,\n/static/ec0ce4de2d05ed3ee2141d0cd508a6ed/473b7/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm.png 768w,\n/static/ec0ce4de2d05ed3ee2141d0cd508a6ed/13e83/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/ec0ce4de2d05ed3ee2141d0cd508a6ed/b3234/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm.webp 192w,\n/static/ec0ce4de2d05ed3ee2141d0cd508a6ed/65a7c/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm.webp 384w,\n/static/ec0ce4de2d05ed3ee2141d0cd508a6ed/30053/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm.webp 768w,\n/static/ec0ce4de2d05ed3ee2141d0cd508a6ed/87027/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"e9f3c312-4f55-5b39-ab9b-d6b1fb3cd9bf","fields":{"slug":"/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"📡 브라우저에서 하드웨어를 직접 제어하는 Web Bluetooth와 Web HID API 완벽 가이드","summary":"웹의 한계를 넘어 물리적 기기와 직접 통신하기","date":"2026.10.20.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/f568a69be9409776010a44fe7d2ec3ce/473b7/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide.png","srcSet":"/static/f568a69be9409776010a44fe7d2ec3ce/be4d9/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide.png 192w,\n/static/f568a69be9409776010a44fe7d2ec3ce/5fc50/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide.png 384w,\n/static/f568a69be9409776010a44fe7d2ec3ce/473b7/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide.png 768w,\n/static/f568a69be9409776010a44fe7d2ec3ce/13e83/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/f568a69be9409776010a44fe7d2ec3ce/b3234/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide.webp 192w,\n/static/f568a69be9409776010a44fe7d2ec3ce/65a7c/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide.webp 384w,\n/static/f568a69be9409776010a44fe7d2ec3ce/30053/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide.webp 768w,\n/static/f568a69be9409776010a44fe7d2ec3ce/87027/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"6284d669-00ba-58b0-8c42-a823f87b3541","fields":{"slug":"/web-locks-api-concurrency-control/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"🔒 Web Locks API 완벽 가이드: 브라우저 다중 탭 동시성 제어와 리더 선출","summary":"탭이 10개 열려도 데이터 꼬임 없는 브라우저 락","date":"2026.10.17.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/473b7/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.png","srcSet":"/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/be4d9/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.png 192w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/5fc50/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.png 384w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/473b7/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.png 768w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/13e83/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/b3234/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.webp 192w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/65a7c/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.webp 384w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/30053/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.webp 768w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/87027/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"0b552678-e6c8-58a5-a27f-f99bb56b0d5f","fields":{"slug":"/webcodecs-api-guide/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"🎬 WebCodecs API 완벽 가이드: 브라우저 초저지연 미디어 인코딩과 디코딩","summary":"브라우저에서 직접 다루는 하드웨어 가속 코덱","date":"2026.10.07.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/4e9d7b308c06334b0db171e699974826/473b7/webcodecs-api-guide.png","srcSet":"/static/4e9d7b308c06334b0db171e699974826/be4d9/webcodecs-api-guide.png 192w,\n/static/4e9d7b308c06334b0db171e699974826/5fc50/webcodecs-api-guide.png 384w,\n/static/4e9d7b308c06334b0db171e699974826/473b7/webcodecs-api-guide.png 768w,\n/static/4e9d7b308c06334b0db171e699974826/13e83/webcodecs-api-guide.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/4e9d7b308c06334b0db171e699974826/b3234/webcodecs-api-guide.webp 192w,\n/static/4e9d7b308c06334b0db171e699974826/65a7c/webcodecs-api-guide.webp 384w,\n/static/4e9d7b308c06334b0db171e699974826/30053/webcodecs-api-guide.webp 768w,\n/static/4e9d7b308c06334b0db171e699974826/87027/webcodecs-api-guide.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}}]},"siteStats":{"available":true,"posts":[{"path":"/navigation-api-spa-routing-guide/","views":3},{"path":"/cloud-tech-overview/","views":1},{"path":"/gatsby/","views":1},{"path":"/islands-architecture-astro-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/popover-api-and-top-layer-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/view-transitions-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-audio-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-bluetooth-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-locks-api-concurrency-control/","views":1},{"path":"/webcodecs-api-guide/","views":1}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/web-worker/","relatedSlugs":["/webcodecs-api-guide/","/sqlite-in-the-browser-wasm/","/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide/","/web-locks-api-concurrency-control/"]}},"staticQueryHashes":["766300711"],"slicesMap":{}}